<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Larut 6-month net up 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Larut 6-month net up 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  28.45     vs	 23.02</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 13.7	vs	 12.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   121.61     vs	132.97</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    53.47     vs	 37.86</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less    6.30     vs  less  2.95</p>
<p>NOTE - Larut Consolidated Bhd is involved in investment holding, and property development and management.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
